---
alwaysApply: true
---
This is a personal portfolio site.
Stack: React + Vite, Tailwind CSS v4.
Design tokens are defined as CSS variables in src/index.css inside an @theme block.
Always use semantic Tailwind classes from these tokens (e.g. bg-surface-primary,
text-text-primary, text-text-secondary, border-border-primary) instead of default
Tailwind colors or hardcoded hex values.
Use the spacing scale (p-4, gap-6, etc.) and radius scale (rounded-xl, etc.)
already defined in the theme — don't invent new values.
Components go in src/components/.